claim.claim-text:
a housing defining an interior, the housing comprising a cover and a stiffener, the stiffener removably connected to the housing;
a circuit board disposed within the interior, wherein the circuit board comprises a plurality of computing components and a thermal interface material disposed on one or more of the computing components;
an input/output connector extending from the housing; and
a heat sink removably connected to the stiffener such that the circuit board is positioned between the stiffener and the heat sink,
wherein the thermal interface material is in contact with the heat sink.
